WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.800
Emulator, Quest 3, synthetic living room. A light peeks over the real couch; depth hides the rest.

00:00:03.800 --> 00:00:08.200
Look (head): the reticle settles, the dwell ring fills, and the light floats to your palm.

00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:12.000
Same light, three ways. Two: point the hand ray and pinch.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:15.800
Three: say "catch". (A recorded test clip through the real Vosk recogniser.)

00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:22.000
Pause menu: high contrast on.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:31.000
High contrast: the real room as bold outlines. The lights left pulse yellow on black.
